      <bpmn:userTask id="W4796_Task5" name="Specify the locker hardware: bank size &amp; compartment mix…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Specify the locker hardware: bank size &amp; compartment mix (small/medium/large/oversize for bulky BOPIS like lumber/tile/appliance packs), indoor/outdoor rating, PWD-accessible lower compartments (RA 7277/BP 344), security (individual door locks, central camera/tamper, anti-theft), payment reader if fee-based (VS-80), and the management controller/API
Responsible (R): Locker Program Manager / IT / Facilities
Accountable (A): GM, Digital Commerce Inc.
Duration: Per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4796_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4796_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4796_Task6" name="Procure: evaluate vendors (W4794 panel), negotiate warranty/parts (VS-31), TCO…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procure: evaluate vendors (W4794 panel), negotiate warranty/parts (VS-31), TCO, and software-update commitment; structure as capex purchase + SaaS or managed-service per the model (W4793)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Locker Program Manager
Accountable (A): GM, Digital Commerce Inc.
Duration: Per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4796_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4796_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4796_Task7" name="Receive, asset-register (VS-35), and stage for installation (W4797); capture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Receive, asset-register (VS-35), and stage for installation (W4797); capture firmware baseline, security certificates, and serial-number-to-location mapping for asset tracking &amp; theft recovery (VS-23)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Asset Mgmt / IT
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager
Duration: Per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4796_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4796_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
