Owner: Locker Program Manager / Facilities (VS-138) / IT (VS-27)
Participants: Facilities, IT, Locker vendor, LP (VS-23)
Source: workflow W4797 — Locker Installation, Access-Control Integration &amp; Commissioning</bpmn:documentation>
