      <bpmn:userTask id="W4797_Task5" name="Install: physical placement/anchoring (PWD-accessible), power/network…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Install: physical placement/anchoring (PWD-accessible), power/network connection, camera/security integration (VS-23), and signage/wayfinding (VS-14); manage via the facilities playbook (VS-138/VS-109)
Responsible (R): Facilities / Locker vendor
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / Facilities Lead
Duration: Per site</bpmn:documentation>
