        <bpmn:outgoing>W4797_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4797_Task6" name="Integrate access-control &amp; systems: connect to the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Integrate access-control &amp; systems: connect to the ERP/ecommerce/order-management (VS-10 W4807), the app/QR/PIN access (VS-75), the loyalty/CRM (VS-13), and any payment (VS-80) and 3P-carrier APIs (W4799); configure access-code generation (W4802) and pickup notifications
Responsible (R): IT / Locker vendor / Ecommerce
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / CIO
Duration: Per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4797_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4797_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4797_Task7" name="Commission &amp; test: end-to-end test (order→assign…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Commission &amp; test: end-to-end test (order→assign compartment→access-code→open→confirm pickup→update order/inventory; returns drop-off; 3P parcel), security/tamper test, PWD-access test, and the go-live readiness check (W4816); record assets (VS-35) and hand to operations
Responsible (R): Facilities / IT / Locker Program Manager
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager
Duration: Per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4797_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4797_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
