      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4798_Task5" name="Identify &amp; evaluate off-site host locations: footfall, demographic fit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identify &amp; evaluate off-site host locations: footfall, demographic fit, catchment to BuildRight customers, access (24/7?), security, and host willingness; prioritize locations that extend BuildRight&#x27;s collection footprint (e.g., a condo near a store with no parking, a transit hub)
Responsible (R): Real Estate / Analytics / Locker Program
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / GM, Digital Commerce Inc.
Duration: Per location</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4798_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4798_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4798_Task6" name="Negotiate the host agreement: lease/host-fee or revenue-share, term/exit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Negotiate the host agreement: lease/host-fee or revenue-share, term/exit, utilities (power/network), access hours, security/liability/insurance (VS-26), branding, and data (VS-91); structure per Real Estate/Legal playbook (VS-97/VS-100.3)
Responsible (R): Real Estate / Legal / Finance
Accountable (A): GM, Digital Commerce Inc. / Legal
Duration: Per location</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4798_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4798_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4798_Task7" name="Deploy (W4797), integrate (W4807), commission, and operate the off-site locker…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Deploy (W4797), integrate (W4807), commission, and operate the off-site locker with host-coordinated security/maintenance; manage the host relationship and renew/exit per the agreement; report off-site performance to analytics (W4815)
Responsible (R): Facilities / IT / Locker Program / LP
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4798_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4798_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4798_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4798_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
