      <bpmn:userTask id="W4799_Task6" name="Integrate the locker API with 3P carriers/marketplaces (the Amazon-Hub model)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Integrate the locker API with 3P carriers/marketplaces (the Amazon-Hub model): allow outside parcels to be delivered into BuildRight lockers for customer pickup, with compartment assignment, access-code delivery to the recipient, and carrier settlement; manage the open API/interoperability (W4794)
Responsible (R): IT / Locker Program / Carrier
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / CIO
Duration: Per carrier</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4799_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4799_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4799_Task7" name="Onboard carriers/marketplaces: contract (revenue-share/fee per parcel, term…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Onboard carriers/marketplaces: contract (revenue-share/fee per parcel, term, SLA, liability for mis-delivery), data-sharing (RA 10173 VS-91 — recipient data), and the DPA/cyber (VS-27.3/VS-161); define compartment-priority rules (BuildRight BOPIS vs 3P allocation)
Responsible (R): Legal / Finance / IT / TPRM
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / Legal
Duration: Per carrier</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4799_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4799_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4799_Task8" name="Operate &amp; reconcile: monitor 3P parcel volume, compartment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Operate &amp; reconcile: monitor 3P parcel volume, compartment availability/priority, recipient-pickup success, abandoned 3P parcels (W4804), carrier settlement (VS-80), and disputes; report 3P contribution to analytics (W4815)
Responsible (R): Finance / IT / Locker Program
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / Finance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4799_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4799_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4799_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4799_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4799_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-722 (ensure controlled execution — Locker Network Strategy, Siting &amp; Deployment (PA-164.1).) | - CTL-722: compartment-priority rules (BOPIS first); carrier SLA + scan-at-drop; abandonment rules (W4804); settlements reconciled
Owner: Locker Program Manager / IT (VS-27) / Finance (VS-80)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
